  m_Name: Parametro_Renda
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Renda
  _titleEn: Income
  _category: 3
  _unlockTrigger: 1
  _summary: "A Renda \xE9 o dinheiro que a prefeitura arrecada para pagar obras e
    servi\xE7os: impostos municipais como IPTU e ISS, mais repasses do estado e da
    Uni\xE3o. Sem caixa, nenhuma pol\xEDtica sai do papel."
  _summaryEn: 'Income is the money the city government collects to pay for works
    and services: local taxes such as property and service taxes, plus transfers
    from the state and federal governments. Without cash, no policy leaves the paper.'
  _realWorld: "No Brasil, muitos munic\xEDpios pequenos dependem mais dos repasses
    federais, como o Fundo de Participa\xE7\xE3o dos Munic\xEDpios, do que da pr\xF3pria
    arrecada\xE7\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: In Brazil, many small municipalities depend more on federal transfers,
    such as the Municipal Participation Fund, than on their own tax collection.
  _tradeOffs: "Aumentar a arrecada\xE7\xE3o costuma ser impopular, e depender de
    repasses deixa a cidade vulner\xE1vel a crises fora do seu controle."
  _tradeOffsEn: Raising revenue is usually unpopular, and depending on transfers
    leaves the city exposed to crises outside its control.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Fundo de Participa\xE7\xE3o dos Munic\xEDpios (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fundo_de_Participa%C3%A7%C3%A3o_dos_Munic%C3%ADpios
